{"articleNo":"2909","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2909&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011-2학기 대학원별 수료자 등록 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.07.28","hit":"9479","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"442\" bgcolor=\"#ccffcc\" height=\"84\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">2011-2학기 대학원(일반, 산업 및 교육)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;수료자 등록 신청 안내</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;대학원(일반, 산업 및 교육) </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">수료(예정)자 중 2012년 2월</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> 학위를 받기 위한 분들은 아래의 사항을 참고하여 신청하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">1. 수료자등록 대상</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 일반대학원, 산업대학원, 교육대학원 수료[예정(′11.08)]자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/FCKeditor/editor/images/smiley/msn/thumbs_up.gif\">&nbsp;<strong><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffff99\">학위수여받고자 하는 학기에만 신청하시기 바랍니다.<br></font></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2. 수료자 등록구분 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;가. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">일 반&nbsp; 등 록 : 논문연구를 계속하고자 하는 자(논문연구과목 이수자)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">논문연구등록 : 논문연구학점 미 취득자(논문연구 미이수자)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><strong><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ccffff\">(논문연구등록생은 논문연구 과목 수강신청을 하여야 합니다.)</font></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">3. 수료자등록신청 및 접수</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 수료자 등록신청기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2011. 08. 01(월) ~ 08. 04(목) [4일간]</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 수료자 등록신청 :&nbsp;<!--StartFragment--> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">원스톱서비스-로그인-학사관리-등록-수료자등록신청</span>\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">(수료자 등록신청 후 반드시 지도교수와 유무선, 이메일로 연락하여 승인을&nbsp;받으셔야 합니다.)</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">4. 수료자 등록생 등록금 납부 금액 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">일반등록 : 등록금액의 5% , 논문연구등록: 등록금액의 10%</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 납부기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2011. 08. 23(화) ~ 08. 26(금) [4일간]</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 고지서 출력방법&nbsp;<br><!--StartFragment--><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; : 원스톱서비스-로그인-학사관리-등록-등록금고지내역조회/출력</span>\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><!--StartFragment--><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 등록금 납부장소 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">농협․대구․신한은행, 우체국</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 등록금 납부금액 : 수료자별 해당되는 등록금액 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center